  "published": "2026-10-25T11:57:30.74Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Empty nodes are preserved (the structure is always kept). Breaking changes: the + and - operators are removed (use Add and Remove); Parent has a private setter and Children is a real read-only list (use Add, Remove, Detach); the static load events moved to LoadOptions and are fired once per node; Statistics has properties instead of fields and ignores empty streams; Detach(node) returns the detached node and, like Remove, throws if the node is not a child; the indexer throws ArgumentOutOfRangeException; AsByte of an empty content is 0, AsVarInt/AsVarUInt throw for more than 8 bytes, FromByteArray copies the array. New: LoadOptions with MaxBytes and MaxNodes; buffered writing and read-ahead on seekable streams; saving keeps the position of the content streams; StructurallyEquals compares trees; reading contents (ToString, conversions, copying) does not change the stream positions.",
